    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730786589805\" id=\"item-6729b1c9f29a1f13137a74b2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-df02d3beee55dcf2c0ff\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Spacious Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is crafted to be a tranquil retreat, with ample light and thoughtful finishes to create a warm and inviting atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Functional Bathroom:</strong> The well-maintained bathroom is designed with simplicity and functionality, providing a comfortable space for daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Open Living Room:</strong> The bright living area serves as the heart of the home, featuring large windows that welcome in natural light, ideal for family gatherings or quiet evenings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Practical Kitchen:</strong> This easy-to-navigate kitchen is equipped with modern appliances and ample storage, making meal prep convenient and enjoyable.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> The secure garage offers parking and additional storage, providing convenience for both vehicles and everyday needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> A spacious backyard provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining, play, or gardening, surrounded by the serene ambiance of the area.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located close to local schools, shops, and parks, 14 Ormond is an excellent choice for families or couples looking to enjoy a comfortable lifestyle with everything they need nearby. This home offers an ideal opportunity to embrace New Zealand living at its best.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6729b275a5ea690cef7facc4&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6729b275a5ea690cef7facc4&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_108675\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6729b2767b78d6413d8745cd\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.co